[[8,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Disconnect the battery negative (-) terminal.</p><p><a href=\"#/3025001\">1016A10</a></p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection from the excess pressure\nsensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Turbocharging sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024332\">K82</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Withdraw the retaining bolt.</p><p>3. Remove the excess pressure sensor</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2002318.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[8,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Position the excess pressure sensor.</p><p>Tighten the bolt.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Turbocharging sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024332\">K82</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/3025001\">1016A10</a></p><p>Connect the battery terminal (-).</p>"],[16,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Proceed with removal <a href=\"#/3025751\">7025A12</a> .</p><p>Proceed with removal <a href=\"#/3025752\">7025A14</a> .</p><p>Proceed with removal <a href=\"#/3025001\">1016A10</a> .</p><p>Ensure that the ignition key is in the\nOFF position, then disconnect the negative battery terminal (-).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3023729\">A1B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection from the excess pressure\nsensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Turbocharging sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024332\">K82</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo the bolt (2a), remove the excess pressure sensor (2b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2048324.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[16,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Replace the excess pressure sensor in its\nhousing and fix it using the bolt.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection to the\nexcess pressure sensor.</p><p>Connect the negative (-) battery terminal.</p><p>Proceed with refitting <a href=\"#/3025001\">1016A10</a> .</p><p>Proceed with refitting <a href=\"#/3025752\">7025A14</a> .</p><p>Proceed with refitting <a href=\"#/3025751\">7025A12</a> .</p>"]]